     )
   }

   <!-- Now are ready to add the logic for displaying the error message
    SO LETS CHANGE THE toggleImportanceOf -->

    INLINE CSS STYLE 
    These come with certain limitations . For instance, 
    so called PSEUDO-CLASSES  cant be used straightforwardly 

    THE OLD THOUGHT OR CONVENTION WAS to separate -> HTML,CSS, and JS in different 
    files whilch didnt seem to scale well in larger applications 
    SO THE PHILOSOPHY OF React bases the division of the application 
    along the lines of its logical functional entities 